# save-load-fail-camp.play -- W8-06-01: a campaign save that fails to load
# ends on the error page, never in a crash. Before the fix the in-place
# rebuild reset the campaign while the scene still pointed at its vehicle art
# (use after free in setup_campaign, ALL01T 0xC0000005).
set render_every 0
set campaign ALL01T.MAP GDI
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 60 input_locked == 1
until 1500 input_locked == 0
wait 5
key f10
wait 2
click "menu:SAVE GAME"
wait 2
click dialog:action
wait 5
cheat poison_next_load
key f10
wait 2
click "menu:LOAD GAME"
wait 2
click dialog:row0
click dialog:action
wait 5
assert scene == error                                     @W8-06-01
wait 30
key escape
until 60 scene != error                                   @W8-06-01
log STILL-RUNNING
end
